  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Compliance Monitoring Agent",
    "splashDescription": "The Compliance Monitoring Agent uses Camunda to provide comprehensive AI-driven compliance monitoring for events in highly regulated industries. It automates risk detection and safeguards through AI-powered contextual analysis, ensuring consistent oversight, faster decision-making, improved audit readiness, and cost efficiency. It is designed to address key challenges in compliance, providing massive time savings, risk reduction, and scalable oversight; helping you ensure a secure and compliant environment.",
